{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"mancala UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"mancala.copy.howAnswer","keys":["mancala.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"El tauler comença amb quatre llavors a cada forat. Escolliu un forat al vostre costat i planteu les seves llavors en sentit antihorari, saltant-vos la botiga de l'altre jugador. Deixeu caure l'última llavor a la vostra botiga per prendre un altre torn. Si cau en un forat buit al vostre costat, captureu les llavors del forat oposat. Quan un costat estigui buit, la partida acaba i les llavors restants van a l'altra botiga.","record_id":"daff5b8bde31a7a19bb7e9f1581be9827c2a3d92bdf48d8ab659140924a242e1","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":2.624307592375004,"source":"The board starts with four seeds in each pit. Choose a pit on your side and sow its seeds counter-clockwise, skipping the other player’s store. Land your last seed in your store to take another turn. If it lands in an empty pit on your side, capture the seeds in the opposite pit. When one side is empty, the game ends and the remaining seeds go to the other store.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"24989f6265660fd7d2d728fc496b155f089e0640e8905caa5716b2c51e6ae6b8","status":"machine-draft","translation":"El tauler comença amb quatre llavors a cada forat. Escolliu un forat al vostre costat i planteu les seves llavors en sentit antihorari, saltant-vos la botiga de l'altre jugador. Deixeu caure l'última llavor a la vostra botiga per prendre un altre torn. Si cau en un forat buit al vostre costat, captureu les llavors del forat oposat. Quan un costat estigui buit, la partida acaba i les llavors restants van a l'altra botiga.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
